ve the  quality  the of it and then have a strong call to  action to join your newsletter give them  something free that they can get from  your newsletter and in there then you  can upsell your your course on happiness  last question from ali i need to find  that autobiographer to help me write a  book who should i contact that's a tough  one that's a very personal relationship  right that's one somebody that you're  now sharing really detailed information  about yourself to if you want to be good  on autobiography it's gotta dig deep  into you and not just be a surface level  stuff for people won't be interested to  its somebody that like you got to work  with them a long time right it's you're  going to meet with them a lot you're  gonna you're gonna ask me somebody  you're feeling comfortable with even  like thinking about how I got Jason help  me with the videos I I demoed and try it  out to other videographers before him  just to see cuz I'm gonna be with you  every week I need somebody who is on my  vibe who you know gives me energy to who  understands what i'm trying to do who  believes in the mission in the first two  people we're okay you know the technical  skills were okay I feel like it's  raining it's raining a little bit but  it's got to be somebody that you can  work with for an extended period of time  because writing an autobiography is no  joke and then someone who has the skills  right somebody who can actually write  somebody who can the hardest thing that  I found and working with writers is  somebody who can match my voice right  training somebody who can match your  voice the way you would say things is  tough now in terms of finding that  person it's not it's not just you know  putting up an ad and saying hey do you  want to write my autobiography I would  look at one people that you already know  i would start spreading the message to  your network you to your friends and say  you're looking for this because there  may be somebody in your circle who could  do it or just by letting them know they  may know somebody right like friends of  friends who might be able to be a good  contact for you and 2 i'd be looking at  books look at other autobiographies look  at other books that have been written  with somebody and see which books you  like like which autobiographies do you  love to read that we're either ghost  written or written with somebody and  find out who that person is and contact  them and what i try to do is set up a  mini-trial where you're you're working  with them on one small part  the book and see who who gets it like  who do you riff with who is asking the  right question who's giving you the  right energy do a bunch of mini trials  because somebody could look great on  paper but until you actually start  working with them you don't really have  a sense of if they're going to be a good  fit for you or not so that's a lot of  questions thank you guys so much if you  have more questions about my book the  book writing process leave it in the  comments below and I will answer it next  week thank you guys so much for watching  continue to believe and I'll see you  soon
 

